          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በቆጵሮስ ፡ የተሠራ ፡ ካህን ፡ ነበር ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": "፴፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፴፯ ፤ ⟪ወቦ ፡ ገራህት ፡ ወሤጦ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እርሻ ፡ ነበረው ፡ ሸጦ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአምጽአ ፡ ሤጦ ፡ ወአንበረ ፡ ታሕተ ፡ እግረ ፡ ሐዋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርያት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋጋውን ፡ አምጥቶ ፡ ከሐዋርያት ፡ ከእግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራቸው ፡ በታች ፡ አፈሰሰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፭ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፤ ⟪ወሀሎ ፡ አሐዱ ፡ ብእሲ ፡ ዘስሙ ፡ ሐናንያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐናንያ ፡ የሚባል ፡ አንድ ፡ ሰው ፡ ነበር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐናንያ ፡ ማለት ፡ በግዕ ፡ ደመና ፡ ማለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ት ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወስመ ፡ ብእሲቱ ፡ ሰጲራ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምሽቱም ፡ ሰጲራ ፡ ትባላለች ፡ ሽቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማለት ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሤጡ ፡ ዐጸዶሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቦታቸውን ፡ ሽጠው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፤ ⟪ወቀሠጠ ፡ መንፈቀ ፡ ሤጡ ፡ ተማኪሮሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምስለ ፡ ብእሲቱ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተማኪሮሙ ፡ ካለ ፡ ሐናንያ ፡ ወብእሲቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምስለ ፡ ብእሲቱ ፡ ካለ ፡ ተማኪሮ ፡ ባለ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በቀና ፡ ነበር ፡ ልማድ ፡ ነው ፡ መዓልት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምስለ ፡ ሌሊት ፡ ይትካፈልዎ ፡ ለዘመን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዕሩይ ፡ ከንቶ ፡ ይትናገሩ ፡ አሐዱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምስለ ፡ ካልኡ ፡ እንዲል ፡ ይህ ፡ ማኅበር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እፈታ ፡ እፈታ ፡ ብሏል ፡ ኋላ ፡ እኛ ፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደምን ፡ እንሆናለን ፡ ብለው ፡ መክረው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኩሌታ፡ዋጋውን፡ከፍለው፡ አስቀርተው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአምጽኡ ፡ መንፈቀ ፡ ሤጡ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኩሌታ ፡ ዋጋውን ፡ አምጥተው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአንበሩ ፡ ታሕተ ፡ እግረ ፡ ሐዋርያት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሐዋርያት ፡ ከእግራቸው ፡ በታች ፡ አፈ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰሱ ፡ ም ፡ ፬ ፡ ፴፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፤ ⟪ወይቤሎ ፡ ጴጥሮስ ፡ ኦ ፡ ሐናንያ ፡ እፎ ፡ መል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አ ፡ ሰይጣን ፡ ውስተ ፡ ልብከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኦ ፡ ቃለ ፡ አኅሥሮ ፡ ነው ፡ ኦ ፡ አብዳን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰብአ ፡ ገላትያ ፡ እንዲል ፡ ሐናንያ ፡ ሰይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣን ፡ በልቡናህ ፡ እንዴት ፡ ሰፈረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ተሐስዎ ፡ ለመንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቦሁ ፡ ዘይሴወር ፡ እምኔየ ፡ እምኔየሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሴወር ፡ አነ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ዘእፈትን ፡ ልበ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወኵልያተ ፡ አነ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ብርሃኑ ፡ ለዓ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለም ፡ ያለ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስን ፡ አላዋቂ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታደርገው ፡ ዘንድ ። አንድም ፡ ስንኳን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከብትህን ፡ ሰውነትህን ፡ አስገዛለታለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያልኸው ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስን ፡ ትክዳው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘንድ ። አንድም ፡ ወአናቅጸ ፡ ሲኦልኒ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢይኄይልዋ ፡ ያለ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታሳብለው ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ሰይጣን ፡ በልቡ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናህ ፡ እንዴት ፡ ሰፈረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወትቅስጥ ፡ እምሤጠ ፡ ዐጸድከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከቦታህ ፡ ዋጋ ፡ ከፍለህ ፡ ታስቀር ፡ ዘ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንድ ፡ ዮሐ ፡ ፲፫ ፡ ፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": "፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፬ ፤ ⟪አኮኑ ፡ ለከ ፡ ነበረ ፡ እምቅድመ ፡ ትሢጦ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳትሸጠው ፡ ያንተ ፡ አልነበረምን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሶበሂ ፡ ሤጥከ ፡ በፈቃድከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብትሸጠውም ፡ ወደህ ፡ ሽጠኸዋል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ለምንትኬ ፡ ሐለይከ ፡ በልብከ ፡ ትግበር ፡ ከመ ፡ ዝ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ ያለ ፡ ሥራ ፡ ትሠራ ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በልቡናህ ፡ ለምን ፡ አሰብህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ለእግዚአብሔርኬ ፡ ሐሰውከ ፡ ወአኮ ፡ ለሰብእ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰውን ፡ ያይደለ ፡ ቦሁ ፡ ዘይሴወር ፡ እም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኔየ ፡ እምኔየሁ ፡ ይሴወር ፡ አነ ፡ ውእቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘእፈትን ፡ ልበ ፡ ወኵልያተ ፡ አነ ፡ ውእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱ ፡ ብርሃኑ ፡ ለዓለም ፡ ያለ ፡ እግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
